+
+## AC-01: proposed bounded Accordion framework interface
+
+Source: pinned [Accordion parts](https://github.com/mui/base-ui/tree/47b40521eab921c2756bf9bdb0b0f07fbfdb8c8c/packages/react/src/accordion), inherited Collapsible/Button/lifecycle helpers at immutable Base UI v1.8.0 `47b40521eab921c2756bf9bdb0b0f07fbfdb8c8c`. The accepted five framework substitutions and A-01 initially undefined refs apply; named generic props/state/value and part/event types represent React namespace aliases. Root defaults retain upstream any. Item-before-Root callbacks, cancellation, array identity, OR-disabled inheritance, DOM-order registration and deprecated keyboard no-ops remain source behavior. Observable timing/ownership adaptations are bounded; no further behavioral correction is approved.
+
+Inherited Button D-03 earns no new credit. Shared Collapsible issues #30/#31/#33 remain preserved source mechanisms; #34 concerns the private lifecycle here because Accordion Root/Item/Header/Trigger state has no transitionStatus. Existing Collapsible runs do not establish Accordion execution. Panel:201 React.Activity remains deferred and uncredited. Evidence and exact applicability are in [compatibility](../parity/accordion/compatibility.md), [component docs](accordion.md) and [verification](../parity/accordion/verification.md). Proposed PR: feature branch, number pending; landing and final-head acceptance are pending. This entry earns no ordinary credit or complete parity claim.
